[REQUIREMENT]
UID: AC-SRS018
TITLE: On an addressed garble, say again and do not accept it
STATEMENT: >>>
An addressed garbled event shall cause the phrase Say again followed by the full call sign and shall not change the phase. A garble that is not addressed to this aircraft shall produce no phrase. Acceptance is exactly one Say again phrase and a ramp phase that is unchanged.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
An unreadable clearance is not a clearance.
<<<
DAL: E
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: High-Level
VERIFICATION: Test
